## 🔧 Troubleshooting

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| `javac` not found | Install JDK 11+ and add to PATH, or use `-JavaHome "C:\Program Files\Java\jdk-17"` |
| `client.jar` not found | Ensure DreamBot is installed and has been launched at least once. If still not found, manually locate the jar using the steps in the script and enter the path. |
| Compilation errors | The script uses only stable API methods. If errors persist, your DreamBot version is very old – update to 4.1.73.1 or later. |
| Script not appearing in DreamBot | Check that the JAR was copied to `%USERPROFILE%\.dreambot\scripts\`. Refresh the local scripts list. |

